1228 W*Q.W \- X*Q.X \- Y*Q.Y \- Z*Q.Z,
1229 W*Q.X \+ X*Q.W \+ Y*Q.Z \- Z*Q.Y,
1230 W*Q.Y \- X*Q.Z \+ Y*Q.W \+ Z*Q.X,
1231 W*Q.Z \+ X*Q.Y \- Y*Q.X \+ Z*Q.W);
